{"id":"00410","root":"uni00410_1","name":{"ja":"井河　さくら","en":"Igawa Sakura"},"title":{"ja":"【Ｘｍａｓアルバイター】","en":"【Xmas Part-Timer】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【Ｘｍａｓアルバイター】 井河　さくら","en":"【Xmas Part-Timer】 Igawa Sakura"},"aliases":["Demon Sakura"],"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-12-15","limited":true,"characterId":27,"profile":{"ja":"次元侵略者ブレインフレーヤーによる騒動の結果こちらの世界に来てしまった別次元のさくら。こちらの世界のさくらと違い、まだ学生である。単身こちらの世界に飛ばされてしまった上に元凶のブレインフレーヤーが消滅して戻れなくなる。仕方がないので、こちらの世界のさくらと遭遇しないように注意しつつ、もとの世界に戻る方法を探している。楽しいイベントが大好きなさくらはこちらの世界でもクリスマスにテンションマックス。さらに年末商戦に合わせて発売されるゲームが欲しいさくらはまたアルバイトをすると言い出す。高給に釣られ、なにやら店の呼び込みのバイトを始めた様だが……？","en":"Sakura from another dimension ended up here after a Brainlayer invasion caused a rift. Unlike this world's Sakura, she's still a student. Stranded alone after the Brainlayer vanished, she can't return home. So she's cautiously avoiding this world's Sakura while searching for a way back, all while getting excited about festive events and hunting for the new year game release, even taking a high-pay part-time job at a shop—though the details are still a mystery."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"黒岩心々","forms":[{"id":"uni00410_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1248,2496],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[193,386],"def":[117,234],"spd":[78,78],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","880004"]},{"id":"uni00410_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1896,3792],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[311,622],"def":[159,318],"spd":[78,78],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","880004","880005"]},{"id":"uni00410_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2544,5093],"sp":[330,330],"atk":[429,857],"def":[201,404],"spd":[78,78],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["4","880004","880005","880006"]}],"skills":{"4":{"slot":"attack","id":4,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"